The <computeroutput>has_npos</computeroutput> concept is satisfied when <computeroutput>T</computeroutput> exposes a static <computeroutput>npos</computeroutput> member, as provided by <computeroutput>std::string_view</computeroutput> and similar types. It is used to detect string-like types for specialised comparison and reporting within the framework. </para>
